WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:01.320 --> 00:00:03.160
Why were you suicidal?

2
00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:07.040
It's because going through
very big states in life,

3
00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:10.720
but I can go so deep
that I don't find a way out.

4
00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:13.920
I know you right now.

5
00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:15.760
You got a lot to give.

6
00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:18.360
-Can you feel me?
-I do.

7
00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:20.000
You and I are gonna make a deal.

8
00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:22.440
I'm gonna show you
what to do to reshape yourself.

9
00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:28.320
<i>How is it that people
can make lasting changes in minutes?</i>

10
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:30.720
<i>What makes that possible?</i>

11
00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:36.200
<i>I'll have one camera on Tony
and one camera on the intervention,</i>

12
00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:37.720
but I don't wanna screw up
what you're doing.

13
00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:39.560
The challenge is,
we never know where he's gonna go.

14
00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:43.680
<i>I'm a kid from Azusa, California,
who did not have any certainty,</i>

15
00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:45.800
<i>but I was certain of one thing.</i>

16
00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:49.200
My insatiable hunger
to end suffering for any human I can.

17
00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:51.440
-Good morning.
-Good morning.

18
00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:53.080
<i>"Date With Destiny"
is my very favorite event.</i>

19
00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:56.160
<i>Just because it covers the controlling
force that controls everything.</i>

20
00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:57.800
<i>-They're ready for you.
-Do you get nervous?</i>

21
00:00:57.880 --> 00:01:00.040
-Is there stage fright?
-No, there's no stage fright.

22
00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:04.240
<i>My job is to dominate the problem
and bring out what's really strong.</i>

23
00:01:04.320 --> 00:01:05.720
<i>-Childhood beating.</i>
-Constant pain.

24
00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:07.320
<i>-Sexual abuse.
-Father abandoned him.</i>

25
00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:08.840
Mother was murdered by stepfather.

26
00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:10.560
<i>Held hostage for three days.</i>

27
00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:13.400
<i>Are you ever concerned about
giving the wrong piece of advice?</i>

28
00:01:13.480 --> 00:01:14.760
<i>I'm looking for what's real,</i>

29
00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:18.520
<i>and when I find it, I take that bait
and take it all the way to the soul.</i>

30
00:01:21.320 --> 00:01:24.480
Our entire life changes in a moment.
Who gets that? Say "aye."

31
00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:25.840
Aye!

32
00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:27.040
<i>Problems are what make us grow.</i>

33
00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:30.040
<i>Authenticity will lead to a rich life.</i>

34
00:01:30.120 --> 00:01:34.200
<i>Life is always happening for us,
not to us.</i>

35
00:01:35.160 --> 00:01:38.200
Everybody's got their thing,
and this is my thing.

36
00:01:40.440 --> 00:01:42.000
<i>You haven't deserved any of it.</i>

37
00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:44.440
But out of pain,
comes unbelievable strength.

38
00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:45.880
You're incredible.

39
00:01:49.440 --> 00:01:51.520
-What did you see in their eyes?
-Love.

40
00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:53.800
How do we get love
from every kind of person?

41
00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:55.160
We do the right thing?

42
00:01:58.440 --> 00:02:00.120
<i>I just really believe
people's love and caring.</i>

43
00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:02.760
If they led with that,
they'd find the way.

44
00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:07.000
One, two, three!
Make the sound of who you are!

45
00:02:20.680 --> 00:02:23.800
<i>Make your life a masterpiece,
my dear friends.</i>

